        <obo:IAO_0000116>For surgery on one root of a bicuspid. Does not include placement of retrograde filling material. If more than one root is treated,  see D3426. 

 ISBN:1935201387#CDT 2011-2012 Current Dental Terminology, Chapter 1</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:cdt_label>apicoectomy/periradicular surgery - bicuspid (first  root)</obo:cdt_label>
