        <obo:IAO_0000116>Root resection of a multi-rooted tooth while leaving the crown.  If the crown is sectioned,  see D3920. 

 ISBN:1935201387#CDT 2011-2012 Current Dental Terminology, Chapter 1</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:cdt_label>root amputation - per root</obo:cdt_label>
        <dc:identifier>D3450</dc:identifier>
