        <obo:IAO_0000112>A tooth lesion caused by bruxism.</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A non-carious tooth lesion that is the result of functional or parafunctional activity of the jaws or a process of friction or an abrasive process</obo:IAO_0000115>
