        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">OBSOLETE. Periodontal pain due to periodontitis as a manifestation of a systematic haematological disorder. Haematological disorders which can result in periodontitis include acquired neutropenia and leukaemia.</obo:IAO_0000115>
