            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>pulpal pain attributed to irreversible pulpitis due to infection of dentin with evidence of a fracture in one of the following: enamel and dentin (uncomplicated crown fracture),  root cementum and dentin (uncomplicated root fracture), or enamel, root cementum and dentin (uncomplicated crown-root fracture).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32103673</obo:IAO_0000119>
