            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pulpal pain attributed to irreversible pulpitis due to infection of dentin because of a crack or incompletel fracture in the enamel or enamel dentin, along with at least one of the following: sharp pain upon biting, pain on release of occlusal biting pressure or external application of force, and cold hypersensitivity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>PMID:32103673</obo:IAO_0000119>
