        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002553"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The paired air-filled cavities surrounded by the bones of the face that are lined by mucous membranes and are continuous with the nasal cavity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:UBPROP_0000011>Arise as epithelial lined diverticula of the lining of the nasal cavity. The extent of sinus development varies with species, most of the development occurs postnatally</obo:UBPROP_0000011>
