        <owl:annotatedTarget>Any of the mushroom-shaped papillae, which have a single taste bud at the tip, located mostly on the dorsal anterior portion of the tongue.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>MGI:smb</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
