        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The articular capsule (capsular ligament) is a thin, loose envelope, attached above to the circumference of the mandibular fossa and the articular tubercle immediately in front; below, to the neck of the condyle of the mandible.</obo:IAO_0000115>
