        <obo:UBPROP_0000001>Rostromedial to the sublingual and mandibular salivary glands Dorsolateral to the mandibular lymph node Ventral to the external acoustic pore, caudal to the extraorbital lacrimal gland, cranioventral to the parotid salivary gland, dorsal to the junction between the superficial temporal vein (v.) and the maxillary v..</obo:UBPROP_0000001>
